      "role": "user",
      "content": "100mg of prednisone a day seems like a really large amount to just start on my own without a doctor's supervision. isn't it dangerous to take that much without having my blood pressure checked or making sure it won't mess up my stomach? i'm a bit worried about the side effects, can i just skip the prednisone for now and just do the ibuprofen and the warm compress like you said first?",
